# API Routes

- Mutations use Route Handlers only — no `"use server"` in this project.
- Start with `getSessionUser()` → role/domain guards from `@/lib/api/helpers` and `@/lib/api/access`.
- Business logic in `src/lib/**`; return `{ error, code }` JSON errors.
- Integration/webhook/cron routes use `integration-endpoints` skill patterns instead.

Load `.cursor/skills/api-server-actions/SKILL.md` or `integration-endpoints/SKILL.md` for full workflow.
